    "description": {
      "value": "<div data-ft-phase5-vocab-scrub=\"v1\" style=\"display:none\"></div>\n<h2>Linebreaker</h2><p><em>Formations exist to be disrespected.</em></p><hr /><h3>Rules</h3><p>When you move at least 3 squares straight toward an enemy and hit with a melee attack, that enemy is Imposed: its reaction strikes roll 3d10 keep-lowest-2 until the end of its next turn.</p><p class=\"ft-engine-note\"><em>🃏 Card — target first: the enemy is Imposed for its reaction strikes until the end of its next turn.</em></p>",
